    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i tried that. i went to a dark room and even then i can still hear my own breathing and everything just feels so heavy and chaotic. it's like there's no real way to get away from it. it's not just about a break, i mean like... i want the noise to actually stop. for good. i just want the absolute silence.",
