    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "visualization isnt doing anything. it just feels like a temporary bandaid on a massive wound. i don't want a \"gentle stream\" or to imagine something. i want what's under the noise. i just want to reach that point where there's nothing left to feel and nothing left to hear. like, total nothingness. is that even possible? i just can't see any other way to actually get that kind of peace.",
